              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "io.projectreactor.netty/reactor-netty: Reactor Netty Credential Leak via Redirects"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In some specific scenarios with chained redirects, Reactor Netty HTTP client leaks credentials. In order for this to happen, the HTTP client must have been explicitly configured to follow redirects."
